>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Live catalog: COBOL CALL into carolina_query (libpq). PIC X is not a
*> C string, so we write a trailing NUL before the trampoline.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CATALOG-QUERY.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
REPOSITORY.
    FUNCTION ALL INTRINSIC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N USAGE BINARY-LONG.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 SQL PIC X(1024).
01 ARG1 PIC X(256).
01 ARG2 PIC X(256).
01 NARGS USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 TSV PIC X(262144).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING SQL ARG1 ARG2 NARGS TSV.
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(SQL)) TO N
    IF N < 1024
        ADD 1 TO N
        MOVE X"00" TO SQL(N:1)
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(ARG1)) TO N
    IF N = 0
        MOVE X"00" TO ARG1(1:1)
    ELSE
        IF N < 256
            ADD 1 TO N
            MOVE X"00" TO ARG1(N:1)
        END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(ARG2)) TO N
    IF N = 0
        MOVE X"00" TO ARG2(1:1)
    ELSE
        IF N < 256
            ADD 1 TO N
            MOVE X"00" TO ARG2(N:1)
        END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO TSV
    CALL "carolina_query" USING SQL ARG1 ARG2 NARGS TSV
    GOBACK.

END PROGRAM CATALOG-QUERY.
